Package: phpswitch
Version: 1.0.0
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: bash, sudo, systemd
Maintainer: afiez <afiez97@users.noreply.github.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/afiez97/phpswitch
Description: Easy PHP version switcher for Ubuntu
 phpswitch switches the active PHP version for the CLI, Apache2 mod_php,
 PHP-FPM, and Nginx in a single command, and auto-updates the Nginx
 fastcgi_pass socket to match. A companion desktop app (phpswitch-desktop)
 provides a native GUI for the same actions on Ubuntu and macOS.
